This product is built on ICU (International Components for Unicode), a mature,
widely used set of C/C++ libraries for Unicode support, software
internationalization, and globalization. ICU is a project of the Unicode
Consortium and is distributed under the Unicode License. Our gratitude to the
ICU project and its many contributors, and to the Unicode Consortium, for
decades of work on the Unicode Collation Algorithm and the CLDR locale
tailorings this module depends on.

  ICU project:      https://icu.unicode.org/
  Unicode License:  https://www.unicode.org/license.txt

When ICU source is vendored into this repository, it is included verbatim under
its own license, and that license text accompanies the vendored source. This
module adds only a thin Go/cgo binding over ICU's collation API; the collation
behavior itself is ICU's.

The packaging approach -- vendoring C source and building it statically via cgo
-- follows the house style of dolthub/gozstd and dolthub/go-icu-regex. No code
is shared with those projects.
